Standards-Version: 4.5.0.3

Package: adaptation-samsung-r7
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         adaptation-hybris-api33-phone,
         adaptation-samsung-r7-configs (= ${binary:Version}),
         openssh-server,
Description: Community adaptation for samsung-r7 - metapackage
 Pulls openssh-server so a first flash always has a working SSH server. USB
 networking (RNDIS) is unreliable on this device and the base image ships no
 SSH server, which left a fresh install with no remote access at all; SSH over
 Wi-Fi is the dependable fallback.

